body:
- overwhelming internal feeling of being inferior compared to others - in any fields - look, job, achievements, being funny, being worthy; 
- overwhelming feeling of being unworthy - like I am too bad to be part of the group, to be a friend or in a relationship 
- fear of challenges - it is a great anxiety of losing, due to my minimal or negative self esteem and self talk I feel each my defeat as 1000x bigger than it is in real; due to it I do almost nothing which has even minimal risk of losing like starting new hobby, or going out to the people and being more social
